---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import FunderForm from "../../components/FunderForm.astro";
const steps = [
  ["Start from your funding page", "Your file points to it, so it should answer the basics."],
  ["List what you fund today", "One entry per call or programme, each marked open, rolling, invitation-only, forecasted or closed."],
  ["Write fti-manifest.json", "Start from the example. Already publish CommonGrants? Link it instead."],
  ["Leave out what you don't know", "\"Not specified\" isn't \"no restriction\". Don't guess."],
  ["Check it", "Use any JSON Schema validator, or send it to us."],
  ["Put it on your site", "Link it from your funding page, and from llms.txt if you have one."],
  ["Tell us", "Send the file's address with the form below."],
  ["Keep it current", "Update the revision when things change. Mark closed calls closed; don't delete them."],
];
---
<Base
  title="How to publish with FtI · ItFtI"
  description="Eight short steps for funders to publish an FtI file: start from your funding page, list what you fund, write fti-manifest.json, check it, put it on your website and tell us."
  current="fti"
>
  <section class="intro grid" aria-labelledby="t">
    <div class="head">
      <h1 id="t">How to publish with FtI</h1>
      <p class="tag rule-dash">For funding teams. No portal, no account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="big">From your funding page to a file people and agents can read.</p>
      <p>You need a text editor and someone who can edit your website.</p>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="slab" href="/examples/fti-manifest.example.json">Get the example file</a>
        <a class="slab-ghost" href="/fti/format">The format</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="course grid" aria-labelledby="steps">
    <h2 id="steps" class="head">Steps</h2>
    <ol class="body steps">
      {steps.map(([t, b]) => (<li><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></li>))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="course grid" id="contact" aria-labelledby="help">
    <h2 id="help" class="head">Need help?</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>No funder has published yet. Be among the first, and we'll check your file.</p>
      <FunderForm id="publish-contact" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { padding-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px); }
  .head { grid-column: 1 / span 4; align-self: start; position: sticky; top: 24px; }
  .body { grid-column: 5 / span 8; display: grid; gap: 1.1em; min-width: 0; }
  .big { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 500; font-size: var(--step-2); line-height: 1.3; max-width: 26ch; }
  .tag { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; font-weight: 600; max-width: 26ch; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 0.4em; }
  .steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; gap: 0; counter-reset: step; }
  .steps li { counter-increment: step; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3.2rem 1fr; column-gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 4px solid var(--red); max-width: none; }
  .steps li::before { content: counter(step); grid-row: span 2; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--step-2); line-height: 1; }
  .steps h3 { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .head, .body { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .head { position: static; }
  }
</style>
